<figure class="cache-figure" data-client-lifecycle>
 <p class="figure-title">A command can outlive the request waiting for it</p>
 <div class="client-stages"><span data-stage="unsent">Unsent queue</span><span data-stage="sent">Written to connection</span><span data-stage="executed">Redis executed</span><span data-stage="replied">Reply received</span></div>
 <div class="cache-copy-pair"><div class="cache-copy"><small>Application result</small><strong data-app>waiting</strong></div><div class="cache-copy"><small>Redis state · observer view</small><strong data-server>unchanged</strong></div></div>
 <p class="figure-note">Client queue timer: <b data-timer>active</b></p>
 <div class="cache-controls"><button data-action="send">Send command</button><button data-action="queue-timeout">Expire queue timer</button><button data-action="execute">Execute in Redis</button><button data-action="deadline">End application wait</button><button data-action="reply">Deliver reply</button><button data-action="disconnect">Lose connection</button><button data-reset>Reset</button></div>
 <p class="explanation" data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p>
 <figcaption>Try Expire queue timer before sending. Then reset, send, end the application wait, execute and deliver the reply. Compare losing the connection before and after execution: the error cannot reveal which occurred. Queue-timer behaviour models node-redis 6.3.0. Application timeout here abandons the wait without cancelling the underlying command; the Redis state is extra observer knowledge.</figcaption>
</figure>
<script>
import {clientInitial,clientStep} from '../../lib/caching/clients.mjs';
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-client-lifecycle]').forEach(root=>{let s=clientInitial();const render=()=>{for(const [name,value]of Object.entries({app:s.app,server:s.server,timer:s.timer?'active while unsent':'removed',explanation:s.message}))root.querySelector(`[data-${name}]`)!.textContent=value;root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-stage]').forEach(el=>el.classList.toggle('active',el.dataset.stage===s.stage));root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-action]').forEach(b=>b.disabled=JSON.stringify(clientStep(s,b.dataset.action!))===JSON.stringify(s));};root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-action]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{s=clientStep(s,b.dataset.action!);render();});root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-reset]')!.onclick=()=>{s=clientInitial();render();};render();});
</script>
